ta-slot=\"s7\">\"We need to address the safety concerns in our neighborhoods. Community policing initiatives are key to reducing crime rates.\"</p>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500\">\n<span><i class=\"far fa-heart mr-1\"></i> 42</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2\">\u2022</span>\n<span><i class=\"far fa-comment mr-1\"></i> 8</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2\">\u2022</span>\n<span><i class=\"far fa-share-square mr-1\"></i> 3</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sentiment-negative border-l-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-r\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"font-semibold\">@LocalNewsHub</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Facebook</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-red-100 text-red-800\">\n                                    Negative\n                                </span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s8\">\"Police response times are unacceptable during peak hours. Residents are losing patience with the lack of adequate resources.\"</p>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500\">\n<span><i class=\"far fa-heart mr-1\"></i> 18</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2\">\u2022</span>\n<span><i class=\"far fa-comment mr-1\"></i> 27</span>\n<span class=\"mx-2\">\u2022</span>\n<span><i class=\"far fa-share-square mr-1\"></i> 5</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Right Column -->\n<div class=\"space-y-6\">\n<!-- Platform Distribution -->\n<section class=\"card bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar mr-2 text-teal-600\"></i> Platform Distribution\n                    </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full platform-twitter flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm font-medium\">Twitter/X</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-slot=\"s9\">42%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2\">\n<div class=\"bg-blue-600 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 42%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full platform-instagram flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm font-medium\">Instagram</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-slot=\"s10\">28%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2\">\n<div class=\"bg-pink-600 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 28%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full platform-facebook flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm font-medium\">Facebook</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-slot=\"s11\">18%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2\">\n<div class=\"bg-blue-700 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 18%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full platform-youtube flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-youtube\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm font-medium\">YouTube</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-slot=\"s12\">10%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2\">\n<div class=\"bg-red-600 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Engagement Metrics -->\n<section class=\"card bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-users mr-2 text-cyan-600\"></i> Engagement Metrics\n                    </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-600\">Likes</span>\n<span class=\"font-bold\" data-slot=\"s13\">2,847</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-600\">Comments</span>\n<span class=\"font-bold\" data-slot=\"s14\">762</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-600\">Shares</span>\n<span class=\"font-bold\" data-slot=\"s15\">431</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-600\">Views</span>\n<span class=\"font-bold\" data-slot=\"s16\">12,456</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Hashtags & Keywords -->\n<section class=\"card bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-hashtag mr-2 text-violet-600\"></i> Trending Topics\n                    </h2>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">\n                            #CommunitySafety\n                        </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800\">\n                            #PoliceReform\n                        </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800\">\n                            #PublicSecurity\n                        </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-red-100 text-red-800\">\n                            #CrimePrevention\n                        </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">\n                            #NeighborhoodWatch\n                        </span>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Intelligence Summary -->\n<section class=\"card bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-bookmark mr-2 text-indigo-600\"></i> Intelligence Summary\n            </h2>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\" data-slot=\"s17\">The monitoring activity shows a moderate increase in community discussions around public safety measures and police reform initiatives. Most sentiment remains positive regarding community engagement efforts, though some negative sentiment has emerged concerning response times.</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\" data-slot=\"s18\">Key platforms for discussion include Twitter/X with the highest volume of mentions (42%), followed by Instagram (28%). Engagement metrics indicate strong community interest in these topics with an average engagement rate of 3.4%.</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-bolt mr-1\"></i> High Priority\n                </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-check-circle mr-1\"></i> Community Focus\n                </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-circle mr-1\"></i> Monitoring Required\n                </span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 text-center text-sm text-gray-500\">\n<p data-slot=\"s19\">\u00a9 2023 Law Enforcement Intelligence Division. This report is confidential and intended for authorized personnel only.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">Generated automatically from monitored social media sources</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>", "slots": [{"slot_